# Byte-for-byte integrity is part of this pack: SHA256SUMS.txt and verify.bat
# compare hashes, so git must never touch line endings or convert anything.
# With -text there is no eol conversion at all, which keeps a fresh clone
# identical to the archive (verified by running verify.bat after cloning).
* -text

*.dll   binary
*.exe   binary
*.pdb   binary
*.zip   binary
